With these numbers the computer can make any number less than
2,147,483,648. It can make any number it needs just using the numbers
you brought me. See if you can do it.
See if you can bring me back the year you were born.
I figure you were born after 1900 so you can just bring back
just the last two digits.
For example, if you were born in 1985 just bring back 85.
And if you were born in 2001 then bring back 101.

