Did you try taking out numbers and adding them?

I think it's easier starting with the big numbers. 64 is the
first number I would take out. Unless you were born before 1964.

If I messed up and the number ended up too big, then I'd think about
which number I added that I didn't want and try again.  Also as
I would keep track of the difference between the number I want and
the number I've gotten up to.

